id:     go:shop/internal/orders.(*Repo).UpdateStatus
kind:   function
module: internal/orders
file:   internal/orders/repo.go:32
doc:    UpdateStatus looks the order up by Stripe charge ID, not order ID.

orders.Repo.UpdateStatus
  orders [table]  writes: UPDATE orders SET status = $2 WHERE charge_id = $1 RETURNING *

Called by:
  orders.Service.MarkPaid
    payments.Handler.HandleWebhook
      POST /webhooks/stripe

Tests:
  (none)
